# Trail Record Shape
# Source: SPEC.md and src/dispatch.rs (RecordingTrail)

Each Trail entry is a JSON object written as one line (newline-delimited JSON):

{
  "execution_id": "<uuid>",
  "evaluation": {
    "tether_title": "<string>",
    "anchor": "<string>",
    "fact_checks": [
      {"fact": "<string>", "operator": "<string>", "expected": "<value>", "result": "matched|not_matched|error"}
    ]
  },
  "plan": {
    "actions": [
      {"capability": "<string>", "arguments": {"<key>": "<value>"}}
    ]
  }
}

Authorisation entries added by the host after evaluation:

{
  "execution_id": "<uuid>",
  "authorisation": {
    "action_id": "<string>",
    "decision": "allow|deny|ask",
    "reason": "<string>"
  }
}
